  title: Toxic - Sources
  description: Toxic spreads from <font="Mohave-Bold SDF"><size=14><color=white>Sources</color></size></font>
    of the foul corruption. Look out for these and seek to bury them in the green
    pastures once more. Sources act like any other Toxic spill, they may sit in a
    <font="Mohave-Bold SDF"><size=14><color=white>Shallow</color></size></font> or
    <font="Mohave-Bold SDF"><size=14><color=white>Deep Pool</color></size></font>,
    and only the Shallow allow our boxes to unfold.
